Creates a deal/opportunity in the pipeline (this is the CRM "lead"), not a person.  
Only deals with `ongoing` status can be created. Status is only `ongoing | won | lost | paused` — not "Contacted".  
Link a person with `contact_ids` from `contacts_create`. Follow-up / next step is a task via `tasks_create`.  
After success, return the CRM id — do not invent the record in chat.

